n catastrophe sur cette planète, elle s’y retrouve en grand danger… Todd jure de la protéger mais, pour réussir, il va devoir révéler sa force intérieure et percer les sombres secrets qui étouffent son monde…","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Anr0l99YkZxvzP29mvqHkHZ50i6.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qCPLtXrTB10UsgAFxsWOB44gDPu.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":6.5,"vote_count":2741,"age_rating":"PG-13","year":"2021","release_date":"2021-02-24","runtime_minutes":109,"status":"Released","country":"الولايات المتحدة","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["فانتازيا","خيال علمي","مغامرة","جريمة","أكشن","دراما"],"genre_keys":["fantasy","scifi","adventure","crime","action","drama"],"similar":["mv445651","mv2207","mv634649","mv76341","mv429617","mv1061474","mv287947","mv297802"],"director":"دوج ليمان","cast":[{"name":"توم هولاند","character":"Todd Hewitt","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xKBAaPIa1c7tzZD3Y0MhBLv4hPE.jpg"},{"name":"ديزي ريدلي","character":"Viola Eade","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9XO1HIKhefHCn7t1D568XcAlHyS.jpg"},{"name":"مادس ميكلسن","character":"Mayor David Prentiss","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/AsX4bdvZ8UCayWTmAf9lAqOA8V7.jpg"},{"name":"ديميان بشير","character":"Ben Moore","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pnp0AGmWu9yaT8HSyYG9VFhYw45.jpg"},{"name":"ديفيد أويلو","character":"Aaron","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7UZHRwOKe2cYxj8SeNUklyPYkns.jpg"},{"name":"Kurt Sutter","character":"Cillian Boyd","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/A4c9xpj2VuZXGvSv6z1S912Xwnd.jpg"},{"name":"سينثيا إيريفو","character":"Hildy","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gIAXqZwZCBqkh2ppfAV4xcnMxki.jpg"},{"name":"Bethany Anne Lind","character":"Karyssa Hewitt","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/d0FjeKbWYhbTzFSimCnC9K1Maza.jpg"},{"name":"Nick Jonas","character":"Davy Prentiss Jr.","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/y79k7wrDeyRb